<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian cenbank calls for bids on 3 pct repos.</title>
<headline>Austrian cenbank calls for bids on 3 pct repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Thursday it was calling for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged fixed 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0800 GMT on Friday, it said.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 16.44 billion schillings, or 14 percent of bids, also at a rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
